  "body": "5/23 Mark Edward Drive is a  brand-new home in one of East Auckland's most sought-after school zones! Whether you're a first-home buyer, young family or investor, this is a fantastic opportunity to secure a modern, low-maintenance home in a premium Half Moon Bay location.\r\n\r\nLot 5 –  Contemporary Comfort and Convenience\r\n• Three bedrooms, including a master with ensuite\r\n• Two full bathrooms plus a separate guest toilet\r\n• Two bedrooms upstairs, with the third bedroom downstairs\r\n• Modern kitchen, dining and living areas designed for comfortable everyday living\r\n• Dedicated off-street parking space \r\n\r\nTop School Zones – All Within Walking Distance!\r\n• Pigeon Mountain Primary – approx. 472m\r\n• Bucklands Beach Intermediate – approx. 671m\r\n• Macleans College – approx. 1.0km\r\n\r\nLocation, Lifestyle and Convenience!\r\nEnjoy easy access to Half Moon Bay Marina, the ferry terminal, local cafés, restaurants and shops. Pigeon Mountain, Glennandrew Park and Half Moon Park are all nearby, offering fantastic outdoor green spaces for the whole family.\r\n\r\nWith excellent schooling, coastal attractions and convenient transport connections, this brand-new home in this location truly has it all!\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing!",
